      "headingRaw": "Five-character-ancient-verseChangJianATWANGCHANGLIN』SRETREAT",
      "translationRaw": "Here，besideacleardeeplake，Youliveaccompaniedbyclouds；OrsoftthroughthepinethemoonarrivesTobeyourownpure-heartedfriend。Yourestunderthatchintheshadowofyourflowers，Yourdewyherbsflourishintheirbedofmoss。Letmeleavetheworld。Letmealight，likeyou，Onyourwesternmountainwithphoenixesandcranes。",
